{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-codifferential-formula","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:q-codifferential-formula","kind":"proposition","title":"Closed formula for the $q$-codifferential $\\delta_q$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-q-ext-deriv","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-reeb-decomposition"],"tags":["codifferential","reeb","adjoint","webster"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QuantumGeometry.q_codifferential_formula","text":"q-codifferential-formula-prop.md","leanSource":"q-codifferential-formula-prop.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:q-codifferential-formula\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d_q = q^{-1}d + (1 - q^{-1})\\varTheta \\wedge \\mathcal{L}_\\xi</code> be the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-exterior derivative. The formal adjoint of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d_q</code> with respect to the Tanaka–Webster inner product <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\langle \\cdot, \\cdot \\rangle_\\varTheta</code> is</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\delta_q =  q^{-1}\\delta +  (1 - q^{-1})\\mathcal{L}_\\xi^* \\circ \\iota_\\xi.</code></pre>\n<p>This is uniquely characterised by the adjoint relation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\langle d_q\\alpha, \\beta \\rangle_\\varTheta = \\langle \\alpha, \\delta_q\\beta \\rangle_\\varTheta</code> for all compactly supported forms <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha, \\beta</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-codifferential-formula-prop.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.17.3","page":"b/prop-q-codifferential-formula","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":1,"warn":2,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":82},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.QuantumGeometry.q_codifferential_formula","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-codifferential-formula-prop.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
